sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Detector as Regex Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Orchestrator,Detector: Flow 1: Text Content Detection

    Orchestrator->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>No Auth
    Note right of Detector: Request payload:<br/>{ contents: [text strings],<br/>  regex_patterns: ["ssn", "email",<br/>  "credit-card", or custom regex] }

    Note right of Detector: 1. Parse request JSON (serde)
    Note right of Detector: 2. For each built-in pattern name:<br/>   - "email" → email regex<br/>   - "ssn" → SSN regex<br/>   - "credit-card" → CC regex
    Note right of Detector: 3. For custom patterns:<br/>   - Compile regex at request time
    Note right of Detector: 4. Apply all patterns to each<br/>   content string
    Note right of Detector: 5. Collect matches with:<br/>   - start/end offsets<br/>   - matched text<br/>   - detection type (pii/custom)<br/>   - detection name<br/>   - score: 1.0

    Detector-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>[{start, end, text, detection_type,<br/> detection_name, score: 1.0}, ...]

    Note over Orchestrator,Detector: Flow 2: Health Check

    Orchestrator->>Detector: GET /health
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK "healthy"
